      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "噢噢，我等着你呢生野。\n你真是越来越沉稳了啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b0eaa72dbfccdd93fef8cfbdd21000cc9d520077b011acff35342fe46a9b99fb",
