    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00083bd3f3e2c61352dc2e35",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "还有……你就是生野的训练员吧。\n哎呀，见到你真是我的荣幸。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2cd38d62cc48f1af199677a9795ca4eb87ff601e41426f9d39691d423e886c4c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1063/storytimeline_501063111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        26,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/26/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9dbe3a1b2a15512aa4b2f329",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "今天我和生野狄杜斯一起，\n去拜访了她的恩师。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9887b812f946dcc317216afa7c9b8fbd731cb614018506e1c7552c361ac9118e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1063/storytimeline_501063111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        27,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/27/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:63e827d25f72107516834304",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "起因是3年结束后有了休息时间，\n生野狄杜斯邀请我\n一起去向恩师汇报情况。",
      "source_fingerprint": "38cba96b4eab9419ae2c77af5d317e01272233c648f546b5bf036d176178a63e",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1063/storytimeline_501063111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        28,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/28/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc9486ff3f64141d9b00dbfa",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "生野的恩师",
      "source_fingerprint": "a93b18abaa62ca31fc7b8ceb6721c2169432e46c72251b50a52b827487c05a1c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
