    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8305ac5bb16db0ab8dffb71d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "更重要的是，它也在为我的工作提供帮助。\n管理辅助AI的建议能力非常出色，\n能提供参考的数据也很多啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "85dafb1cb462943470e96446a06f639031d66bae4e4b2dc4e022c5db622a670c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1063/storytimeline_501063111.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        31,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/31/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e28b0a05dcdb525f2526f79c",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "能听到您这么说，我非常荣幸",
      "source_fingerprint": "fe1630f31a36919e4898f23b1431eeeb495adff8a1091c785c949be76096cbda",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
